<title>CANADA: Canadian West Coast Vessel Loadings - CWB.</title>
<headline>Canadian West Coast Vessel Loadings - CWB.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Canadian Wheat Board reported three vessels cleared, three vessels loading, four waiting and three due at the Canadian West Coast, as of Friday.</p>
<p>The longest wait to load was 13 days.</p>
<p>    Port	 Loading	Waiting</p>
<p>    Vancouver     n/a	     4</p>
<p>    Prince Rupert n/a	     0</p>
<p>Breakdown on loading was not immediately available.</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk 312-408 8720</p>
</text>
